WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.530
Each day, KiddieTrac writes a short story of your child's day, from everything the educators logged.

2
00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:14.200
It builds through the day and is ready by the evening, so it's normal for it to be short in the morning.

3
00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:23.080
It only describes what was logged: meals, naps, activities and notes. The timeline below shows each one.

4
00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:29.850
If something in it doesn't match your child's day, check the timeline first, then message the room team.
